[
  {
    "title": "Responsible Computing",
    "tag": "Lesson 30 · 负责任的计算",
    "time": "0–2 min",
    "code": "Topic 5.5 · IOC-1.F",
    "html": "<p class=\"big\">Use evidence to justify what we build, collect and share.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Permission: What is allowed? → Attribution: Whose work is it? → Impact: Who benefits or is harmed?\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Permission</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">What is allowed?</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Attribution</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Whose work is it?</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Impact</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Who benefits or is harmed?</text></svg></figure><p class=\"small\">Community Shade Map · a fictional chapter investigation</p>",
    "note": "本课先分清知识产权、许可和引用，再用统一虚构案例完成第六章综合评审。不要将“网上看得到”当成“可任意再发布”，也不要把所有伦理问题缩减为是否违法。后半课按证据与条件评分。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Retrieve three different limits",
    "tag": "Do now · 提取复习",
    "time": "2–5 min",
    "code": "Retrieval · Impact and security",
    "html": "<p>Explain why each claim is too strong:<br>“Access means everyone participates.”<br>“A balanced zone sample removes every bias.”<br>“Encryption proves that a request is honest.”</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><p>Access enables participation but does not guarantee it. Within-group bias may remain. Encryption protects content in transit, not the honesty of the request.</p></div></details>",
    "note": "用前三课的关键边界启动：机会不是行为、组间比例不是全部偏差、加密不是可信内容。不要求引用具体数字，先让学生用原因修正说法，为调查中写局限而非绝对保证做准备。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Today’s success criteria",
    "tag": "Targets · 学习目标",
    "time": "5–8 min",
    "code": "IOC-1.F · Evidence and ethics",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Explain conditions before making a reuse decision.; Interpret: Given permission terms, Credit: A clear source record, Recommend: Evidence + a limitation\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 193\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Explain conditions before making a reuse decision.</text><rect x=\"50.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Interpret</text><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Given permission terms</text><rect x=\"416.6666666666667\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Credit</text><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">A clear source record</text><rect x=\"783.3333333333334\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Recommend</text><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Evidence + a limitation</text></svg></figure><p>Complete a four-part review of the fictional Community Shade Map. Several recommendations can be defensible.</p>",
    "note": "评价的是学生能否解释给定许可条件、清楚记录来源、用证据支持项目建议。不是考六种许可名称背诵，也不是要求与教师持相同立场。四项调查都需要判断依据，防止只填一个同意或反对。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Available online does not mean free to reuse",
    "tag": "Concept · 知识产权",
    "time": "8–11 min",
    "code": "IOC-1.F.1–4",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Creator or organization: Intellectual property → Online availability: Easy to access or copy → Permission terms: Determine allowed reuse\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Creator or organization</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Intellectual property</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Online availability</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Easy to access or copy</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Permission terms</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Determine allowed reuse</text></svg></figure><p>Digital copying is easy. Permission and attribution still matter.</p>",
    "note": "知识产权可属于个人或组织，图中的所有权不会因上传网络自动消失。可访问、可免费下载、允许复制和允许改编是不同条件。避免法域例外讨论，本课仅根据明确给定的许可决定行动。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Permission and credit solve different problems",
    "tag": "Concept · 许可与署名",
    "time": "11–14 min",
    "code": "IOC-1.F.3–6",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A credit line does not create permission.; Permission: May I use it this way?, Attribution: Whose work did I use?\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 193\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">A credit line does not create permission.</text><rect x=\"50.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"535.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"317.5\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Permission</text><text x=\"317.5\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">May I use it this way?</text><rect x=\"600.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"535.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"867.5\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Attribution</text><text x=\"867.5\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Whose work did I use?</text></svg></figure><p>Permission does not remove the need to follow credit conditions. Presenting another person’s work as your own is plagiarism.</p>",
    "note": "先让学生用两句话区分“获准做什么”与“承认贡献来自谁”。单独写作者名字并不能让未获准的复制变为许可使用；已获许可也不应冒充原创。CED 对抄袭与可能法律后果有说明，本课不判定具体法律争议。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Openness can broaden access",
    "tag": "Concept · 开放与条件",
    "time": "14–17 min",
    "code": "IOC-1.F.5–7",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A clear license: Specified permissions → Sharing and adaptation: Reuse under conditions → Wider access: More people can benefit\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">A clear license</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Specified permissions</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Sharing and adaptation</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Reuse under conditions</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Wider access</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">More people can benefit</text></svg></figure><p>Open mechanisms can support collaboration while preserving authorship and license conditions.</p>",
    "note": "开放不是无规则；许可把允许的行为与条件说清楚。可以联系开源库和开放研究提高访问机会，同时提醒不是每种开放机制都允许相同用途。收益应写为“可以扩大”而非一定让所有人参与。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Open source and open access have different subjects",
    "tag": "Concept · 开源与开放获取",
    "time": "17–20 min",
    "code": "IOC-1.F.5–7",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Visible source code alone is not an open-source license.; Open source: Code + reuse license, Open access: Research + broad access\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 193\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Visible source code alone is not an open-source license.</text><rect x=\"50.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"535.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"317.5\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Open source</text><text x=\"317.5\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Code + reuse license</text><rect x=\"600.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"535.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"867.5\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Open access</text><text x=\"867.5\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Research + broad access</text></svg></figure><p>Open source permits modification and redistribution under its license. Open access broadens research access and many uses; authorship and terms still matter.</p>",
    "note": "开源不等于 GitHub 上可见代码，必须存在允许修改与再分发等权利的许可。开放获取针对研究成果，免访问限制及许多使用限制，不等于作者放弃所有权。免费读到一张研究图，不足以推断能复制发布。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Creative Commons licenses have different conditions",
    "tag": "Concept · 许可条件",
    "time": "20–23 min",
    "code": "IOC-1.F.5–6 · License conditions",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Read the actual license before choosing a use.; BY: give attribution, SA: share alike*, NC: noncommercial, ND: no shared adaptations\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 193\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Read the actual license before choosing a use.</text><rect x=\"50.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"260.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"180.0\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">BY</text><text x=\"180.0\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">give attribution</text><rect x=\"325.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"260.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"455.0\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">SA</text><text x=\"455.0\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">share alike*</text><rect x=\"600.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"260.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"730.0\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">NC</text><text x=\"730.0\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">noncommercial</text><rect x=\"875.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"260.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">ND</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">no shared adaptations</text></svg></figure><p class=\"visual-note\">*Share adapted material under the same or a compatible license. ND limits sharing adaptations; it is not a blanket ban on private editing.</p>",
    "note": "这些标签用于理解许可可能存在不同条件，不要求背诵六种完整许可证。SA 对改编作品共享有同许可或兼容要求；ND 不能误教为任何私人修改都被禁止。后面作业以四张原创简化卡为准，不伪称它们是完整 CC 文本。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Card A: permission with credit and changes",
    "tag": "Worked example · 简化许可卡",
    "time": "23–26 min",
    "code": "IOC-1.F.5–6 · Card A",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A · Shade icon: Share + adapt → Any purpose: Follow the conditions → Required record: Credit + mark changes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">A · Shade icon</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Share + adapt</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Any purpose</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Follow the conditions</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Required record</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Credit + mark changes</text></svg></figure><p>Example record: “Shade icon by the named creator; source: Card A; adapted by our team to change the colors.”</p><p class=\"small\">Original simplified classroom card—not the full text of a CC license.</p>",
    "note": "明确 A 已给分享与改编许可，可用于任何目的，但需署名并标改。示范记录使用卡片提供的创作者和来源；如果课堂材料没有人名，不要编造真人。展示中的署名只是本课堂简化许可记录，不代替真实 CC 链接等完整条件。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Card B: permission to read is not permission to copy",
    "tag": "Scenario · 简化许可卡",
    "time": "26–29 min",
    "code": "IOC-1.F.2–6 · Card B",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"B · Research figure: Read permission only → Planned action: Copy into a public map → Decision needed: Ask or replace\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">B · Research figure</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Read permission only</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Planned action</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Copy into a public map</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Decision needed</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Ask or replace</text></svg></figure><p>A source citation acknowledges the work. It does not expand the permission supplied by this card.</p>",
    "note": "不将 B 称为正式 open access license，因为它在题目中只授予阅读许可。可请求另获复制许可后再按条件使用，也可换成自己创作或明确授权材料。不是断言全部研究图都不可复用，是按此卡边界判断。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Cards C and D: evidence changes the next step",
    "tag": "Scenario · 简化许可卡",
    "time": "29–32 min",
    "code": "IOC-1.F.1–6 · Cards C/D",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Use the stated evidence; do not invent permission.; C · Own code: This project is allowed, D · Photo: No license information\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 193\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Use the stated evidence; do not invent permission.</text><rect x=\"50.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"535.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"317.5\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">C · Own code</text><text x=\"317.5\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">This project is allowed</text><rect x=\"600.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"535.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"867.5\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">D · Photo</text><text x=\"867.5\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">No license information</text></svg></figure><p>C: use the self-created code and record its author.<br>D: seek permission or replace the photo before reuse.</p>",
    "note": "C 明确为自己创作且本项目获准使用，记录作者，不为它擅自宣布公共领域或开放源代码许可。D 缺失许可信息，不能从可下载或无水印推导许可；请求许可或换用明确允许的材料均可。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Keep a usable credit record",
    "tag": "Practice · 引用记录",
    "time": "32–35 min",
    "code": "IOC-1.F.6 · Attribution",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Identify: Creator + material → Locate: Source + stated terms → Describe: What you changed\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Identify</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Creator + material</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Locate</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Source + stated terms</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Describe</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">What you changed</text></svg></figure><p>For Card A, draft a credit record for a resized icon. Use the supplied creator/source identifiers.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><p>Identify the icon and creator, locate Card A as the source, and state that the icon was resized. Keep the “Credit + changes” conditions with the record.</p></div></details>",
    "note": "先独立写后揭示。评分不是要求固定标点格式，而是可追溯的材料与作者、来源和修改信息。真实许可还可能有链接或其他条件，应读实际许可；此处只据原创简化卡，不把示范当成完整法律文书。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Ethical review asks who is affected",
    "tag": "Concept · 伦理影响",
    "time": "35–39 min",
    "code": "IOC-1.F.8–11",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Benefit: Whose need is served? → Potential harm: Who is excluded or exposed? → Evidence: What evidence matters?\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Benefit</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Whose need is served?</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Potential harm</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Who is excluded or exposed?</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Evidence</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">What evidence matters?</text></svg></figure><p>Consider access, biased decisions and persistent monitoring. A permitted use can still deserve an ethical review.</p>",
    "note": "本课不把合法等同于伦理充分，也不预设技术使用必然好或坏。让学生指向具体群体与机制：设备门槛、非响应偏差、持续定位等。评价可接受多种建议，但必须说出证据、潜在伤害和可实施改进。"
  },
  {
    "title": "One case, four kinds of evidence",
    "tag": "Project brief · 虚构社区案例",
    "time": "39–42 min",
    "code": "Chapter 6 · Investigation",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Community Shade Map: North/South shade priorities; Access: Who can take part?, Bias: Whose reports?, Protection: Data + access?, Reuse: Allowed materials?\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 193\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Community Shade Map: North/South shade priorities</text><rect x=\"50.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"260.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"180.0\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Access</text><text x=\"180.0\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Who can take part?</text><rect x=\"325.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"260.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"455.0\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Bias</text><text x=\"455.0\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Whose reports?</text><rect x=\"600.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"260.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"730.0\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Protection</text><text x=\"730.0\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Data + access?</text><rect x=\"875.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"260.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Reuse</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Allowed materials?</text></svg></figure><p>All residents, counts and permission cards are fictional. The purpose requires zone summaries, not named or precisely located reports.</p>",
    "note": "统一项目目标为区域汇总，不增加实名回访或精确路线需求。数字是教学合成模型，不是真实社区调查结论。发放两页记录表，四个栏目对应本页，允许小组分工但每个人要能说明至少一个跨领域关系。"
  },
  {
    "title": "The review must justify four decisions",
    "tag": "Project contract · 35 minutes",
    "time": "42–45 min",
    "code": "Chapter 6 · Evidence requirements",
    "html": "<p>1. Access: a budgeted intervention with participant-count evidence.<br>2. Bias: compare 32% and 44%, then identify a limit.<br>3. Security: necessary fields, one safeguard and a remaining risk.<br>4. Reuse: a permission-based action and a credit record.</p><p class=\"small\"><a href=\"output/pdf/AP_CSP_Chapter_6_Investigation_Sheet.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open the two-page investigation sheet</a>. This is a classroom project, not the formal Create task.</p>",
    "note": "这页是报告交付标准，32和44作为已给模型基准，不再当隐藏求值题。每部分一个可解释决定，不要求唯一伦理立场。让学生预览记录表所有栏，明确35分钟结束时需提交四条完整建议和局限。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Project 1: plan the evidence trail",
    "tag": "Investigation · 45–50",
    "time": "45–50 min",
    "code": "Chapter 6 · Investigation",
    "html": "<p><a href=\"Chapter_6_Impact_Lab.html#responsibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open the Impact lab</a>. Use its Access, Bias, Security and Responsibility workspaces.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Predict: Write an initial decision → Investigate: Change one model setting → Record: Evidence + limitation\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Predict</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Write an initial decision</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Investigate</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Change one model setting</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Record</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Evidence + limitation</text></svg></figure><p>Choose a recorder and a checker. Every recommendation needs a reason tied to this case.</p>",
    "note": "启动5分钟先规划，不急着复制反馈。四站使用同一目的与数据，记录一次预判和至少一次观察。小组分工可以加快操作，但检查者要验证数字与许可条件，不能把所有判断交给同一人。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Project 2: remove barriers within the budget",
    "tag": "Investigation · 50–58",
    "time": "50–58 min",
    "code": "Chapter 6 · Access evidence",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Network 2 · device 2 · skills 1 · accessible UI 1; 100 people: 40 initially eligible, Budget: 4 cost units, Choose: Cost + eligibility count\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 193\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Network 2 · device 2 · skills 1 · accessible UI 1</text><rect x=\"50.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">100 people</text><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">40 initially eligible</text><rect x=\"416.6666666666667\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Budget</text><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">4 cost units</text><rect x=\"783.3333333333334\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Choose</text><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Cost + eligibility count</text></svg></figure><p>In Access, compare interventions. Show how the selected barriers change the eligible count. Explain why eligibility does not guarantee participation.</p>",
    "note": "教师参考：网络和设备合计4，40无障碍+20仅网络+15仅设备+10双障碍=85；另外10技能与5可访问UI障碍尚未解决。其他方案可有伦理理由，必须如实报告对应人数。任务需要说明85基准，不把人数最大化当唯一价值。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Project 3: distinguish sample and population mix",
    "tag": "Investigation · 58–66",
    "time": "58–66 min",
    "code": "Chapter 6 · Bias evidence",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Use the synthetic within-group rates supplied by the model.; Group need rates: North 20% · South 80%, Sample mix: North 80% · South 20%, Population mix: North 60% · South 40%\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 193\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Use the synthetic within-group rates supplied by the model.</text><rect x=\"50.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Group need rates</text><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">North 20% · South 80%</text><rect x=\"416.6666666666667\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Sample mix</text><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">North 80% · South 20%</text><rect x=\"783.3333333333334\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Population mix</text><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">North 60% · South 40%</text></svg></figure><p>In Bias, compare the sample estimate with the population-weighted reference. Show the calculation and explain what matching zone shares cannot fix.</p>",
    "note": "教师参考0.8×20%+0.2×80%=32%；0.6×20%+0.4×80%=44%，差12个百分点。44不是现实真值保证，只是按给定组内率的人口比例基准。区内非响应或测量偏差仍可能存在，不能把比例匹配当万全纠偏。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Project 4: protect the stated purpose",
    "tag": "Investigation · 66–74",
    "time": "66–74 min",
    "code": "Chapter 6 · Privacy evidence",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Data: Necessary fields only → Safeguard: A matched protection → Remaining risk: One concrete limit\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Data</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Necessary fields only</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Safeguard</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">A matched protection</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Remaining risk</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">One concrete limit</text></svg></figure><p>In Security, justify a release format and one authentication or encryption choice. Explain how the choice helps and what it cannot guarantee.</p>",
    "note": "记录 zone+shadeRating，通常采用区域聚合发布并解释剩余重识别或数据链接风险。措施可用跨类别 MFA 或正确的对称/公钥保密角色，但必须说明作用；不要用密钥图替代必要字段判断。按本课模型，不提交个人数据。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Project 5: reuse responsibly and submit",
    "tag": "Investigation · 74–80",
    "time": "74–80 min",
    "code": "IOC-1.F · Project conclusion",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"In Responsibility, choose an action and explain its conditions.; A: Credit + changes, B: Read permission only, C: Own project code, D: Permission unknown\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 193\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">In Responsibility, choose an action and explain its conditions.</text><rect x=\"50.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"260.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"180.0\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">A</text><text x=\"180.0\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Credit + changes</text><rect x=\"325.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"260.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"455.0\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">B</text><text x=\"455.0\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Read permission only</text><rect x=\"600.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"260.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"730.0\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">C</text><text x=\"730.0\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Own project code</text><rect x=\"875.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"260.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">D</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Permission unknown</text></svg></figure><p>Complete a credit record for one permitted material. Submit all four evidence sections, including one remaining limitation in each relevant decision.</p>",
    "note": "A 可按信用与标改使用；B 可请求另获复制许可或替换；C 本项目使用并记录作者；D 不能默认许可，可问或换。最后一分钟核四项齐全。没有许可的材料即使给出处也不变成已获准，不能只在界面选reuse而无解释。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Select exactly TWO defensible statements",
    "tag": "AP-style check · 原创",
    "time": "80–83 min",
    "code": "IOC-1.F.5–11 · Original check",
    "html": "<p>A. A credit line automatically grants copying permission.<br>B. Matching zone proportions removes every source of bias.<br>C. Open-source reuse still follows its license conditions.<br>D. Computing decisions can affect groups unequally.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><p><strong>C and D.</strong> Attribution does not grant permission, and within-group or measurement bias can remain.</p></div></details>",
    "note": "做完项目后回到两个最容易泛化的判断。每个学生要解释一个错项，而不是只报字母。若A仍多人错，用B卡的阅读许可再次分开“承认来源”与“复制授权”；若B错，用区内不回应者反例。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Homework: decisions need evidence",
    "tag": "Independent practice · 作业",
    "time": "83–85 min",
    "code": "Chapter 6 · Original assessment",
    "html": "<p>12 original questions · 30 marks · about 40 minutes. Q5 requires exactly TWO answers.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Permission cases: Use the supplied terms → Model calculations: State the assumptions → Recommendations: Evidence + limit\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Permission cases</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Use the supplied terms</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Model calculations</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">State the assumptions</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Recommendations</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Evidence + limit</text></svg></figure><p>Use synthetic data and classroom permission cards. Explain the chosen action rather than guessing a legal label.</p>",
    "note": "作业为原创 AP 风格选择题及课堂书面题，教师分数不是官方评分。后六题覆盖许可、数字鸿沟、采样偏差与隐私安全，均按四个独立点给分。允许多种条件满足的许可处理，不用个人观点决定分数。"
