    "title": "Exit ticket: a responsible recommendation",
    "tag": "Exit · 85–90",
    "time": "85–90 min",
    "code": "Chapter 6 · Exit review",
    "html": "<p>1. What can a credit line do—and what can it not do?<br>2. Give one numerical reason for changing the map design.<br>3. Name one risk your proposed change leaves unresolved.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><p>Credit acknowledges the source; it does not create missing permission. Numerical evidence may use access 40 → 85 or sample 32% versus reference 44%. Explain a specific remaining risk.</p></div></details>",
    "note": "退出卡不追求唯一建议，要求“措施—证据—局限”闭环。允许网络设备优先或其他有理由方案，但数字必须对应模型。若学生把85写作实际参与数或把44写作保证真实值，单独反馈假设与现实差别。"
